        "body": "Steps read \"Bước n — <title>\", in Vietnamese, using the terms from the course slides (vòng S, quay 180° qua tâm, WTG/WTL, mạch Γ / mạch ┐). Equations are typeset in MathJax SVG and shrink to fit instead of clipping.",
        "section": "typography"
