      {
        "name": "The Dim-Not-Lift Rule",
        "body": "Selection on the chart is shown by thickening the selected item (trace 3px → 4.5px, badge filled solid) and dimming the rest to 20%. Never add shadows or glows to chart elements.",
        "section": "elevation"
